for a contradiction that NG (M ) is not a clique in H and let {u, v} be a non-edge of H with
u, v ∈ NG (M ). Since |F | ⩽ k there exists 1 ⩽ j ⩽ k + 1 such that {uj , vj } ∈     / F and for every
